    <p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:18px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;max-width:660px;margin:0 0 32px;text-wrap:pretty;">Hana manufactures rugged RFID tire tags designed to withstand vulcanization and continued mechanical loading throughout the service life of the tire. The process combines die attach, rubber-compatible antenna construction, encapsulation and 100% read verification.</p>
    <div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);width:100%;height:407px;"><img src="~/images/photos/mk-rfid-tire-tags-hero.webp" alt="Rubber-embeddable RFID tire tags" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;"></div>
    <div class="hana-spec-block" style="margin-top:18px;"><div class="hana-spec-item"><div class="hana-spec-label" style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Survivable</div><div class="hana-spec-value" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:17px;">Vulcanization</div></div><div class="hana-spec-item"><div class="hana-spec-label" style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Protected</div><div class="hana-spec-value" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:17px;">Over-mold</div></div><div class="hana-spec-item"><div class="hana-spec-label" style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Read range</div><div class="hana-spec-value" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:22px;">UHF</div></div><div class="hana-spec-item"><div class="hana-spec-label" style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Read tested</div><div class="hana-spec-value" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:22px;">100%</div></div></div>
  </div></div></div>
