      </div>
    </div>
      <div class="sc-pillar" style="border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);overflow:hidden;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;">
      <div style="padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1;">
        <div style="width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--hana-blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:14px;"><i data-lucide="box" style="width:18px;height:18px;"></i></div>
        <div style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin-bottom:10px;">Encapsulation</div>
        <p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 16px;">Over-molding and encapsulation protect the RFID assembly through tire cure and subsequent flexing in service.</p>
        <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 16px;"><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">Over-molding for cure survival</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">Flex-tolerant construction</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">Chemical and heat resistance</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">Built for the tire’s service life</span></li></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
      <div class="sc-pillar" style="border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);overflow:hidden;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;">
      <div style="padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1;">
        <div style="width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--hana-blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:14px;"><i data-lucide="radio" style="width:18px;height:18px;"></i></div>
        <div style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin-bottom:10px;">Read test</div>
        <p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 16px;">Each tag is encoded and electrically verified before shipment.</p>
        <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 16px;"><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">Encode and read verification</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">100% read test</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">Per-unit traceability, default</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">Read performance checked to spec</span></li></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div></div></div>
<section class="wr-sec" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--surface) 0%,var(--surface) 34%,var(--bg) 78%);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><img class="wr-bg" src="~/images/photos/mk-rfid-tire-warehouse.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:60px;padding-bottom:60px;padding-left:60px;padding-right:60px;position:relative;z-index:1;"><div class="wr-grid"><div><h2 class="mk-h2">Why Hana RFID?</h2><p class="mk-body" style="margin:14px 0 26px;">Hana RFID is dedicated to the Tire Industry, designing and producing Tire Tags 24/7. With a network of local, State-of-the-Art production facilities and warehouses, Hana is able to support its customers locally on all major continents.</p><a class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" href="https://hanarfid.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Visit Hana RFID <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div><div class="wr-stats"><div class="wr-stat"><i data-lucide="trophy"></i><div class="v">Global #1</div><div class="l">Embeddable Tire Tag Manufacturer</div></div><div class="wr-stat"><i data-lucide="disc-3"></i><div class="v">Over 250 million</div><div class="l">Tires Tagged (2025)</div></div><div class="wr-stat"><i data-lucide="history"></i><div class="v">Since 2005</div><div class="l">Global Tire Tag Design and Manufacturing</div></div><div class="wr-stat"><i data-lucide="file-badge"></i><div class="v">Certified and Approved</div><div class="l">By all Major Tire Manufacturers</div></div><div class="wr-stat"><i data-lucide="cpu"></i><div class="v">IC Independent</div><div class="l">Offering includes Impinj, NXP, ASYGN, Oxzon, etc.</div></div><div class="wr-stat"><i data-lucide="scan-line"></i><div class="v">100% Quality Tested</div><div class="l">Reading, writing and power</div></div></div></div></div></section>
<div style="background:#fff;"><div class="cap-section"><div style="margin-bottom:8px;"><div style="margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0;">Frequently asked questions</h2></div>
    <div style="border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);overflow:hidden;background:#fff;">
      <details class="sc-faq" open>
      <summary>What makes a tire tag different from a standard RFID tag?<span class="sc-faq-mk">+</span></summary>
      <div class="sc-faq-a">A tire tag must withstand the heat and pressure of vulcanization and continued flexing during service. The antenna, chip attach and encapsulation are therefore developed around the tire environment while maintaining reliable read performance.</div>
    </details>
      <details class="sc-faq">
      <summary>What frequency do the tags use?<span class="sc-faq-mk">+</span></summary>
      <div class="sc-faq-a">Hana supports UHF tire-tag constructions, with read performance tuned to the application. Specific performance figures are confirmed for each program.</div>
    </details>
      <details class="sc-faq">
      <summary>Are the tags tested before shipping?<span class="sc-faq-mk">+</span></summary>
      <div class="sc-faq-a">Yes. Every tag is encoded and read-verified, with 100% read testing and per-unit traceability.</div>
    </details>
      <details class="sc-faq">
      <summary>What quality systems cover tire tags?<span class="sc-faq-mk">+</span></summary>
      <div class="sc-faq-a">ISO 9001 applies group-wide and IATF 16949 applies to automotive work, with production in ESD-controlled areas meeting ANSI/ESD S20.20.</div>
    </details>
    </div>
  </div></div></div>

